{"number": 3, "kind": "pr", "state": "open", "title": "Quote tag arguments in the list filter", "url": "https://github.com/someonesalter/quillpad/pull/3", "author": "someonesalter", "created_at": "2026-10-07T06:56:28Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-08T02:08:21Z", "labels": [], "comments_count": 1, "proposed_labels": ["bug"], "labels_reviewed": false, "action": "none", "reason": "Fixes #2 by quoting tags, but changes the header format without a migration.", "triaged_at": "2026-10-19T14:46:10Z", "triaged_by": "agent:Maya Ortiz", "batch_id": "seed", "agent_notes": "Read the full diff. `parse_filter` now uses `csv`, and the header separator changes from spaces to commas. Existing multi-tag notes would read back as a single tag. Competes with #4.", "review_request": null, "maintainer_notes": "", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-19T14:45:48Z", "last_synced_at": "2026-10-19T14:56:55Z", "state_reason": null}
{"number": 4, "kind": "pr", "state": "open", "title": "Normalize tags to slugs when saving", "url": "https://github.com/someonesalter/quillpad/pull/4", "author": "someonesalter", "created_at": "2026-10-07T06:56:31Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-08T02:08:22Z", "labels": [], "comments_count": 0, "proposed_labels": ["bug"], "labels_reviewed": false, "action": "none", "reason": "Fixes #2 by saving tags as slugs; keeps the header format.", "triaged_at": "2026-10-19T14:46:10Z", "triaged_by": "agent:Maya Ortiz", "batch_id": "seed", "agent_notes": "Read the full diff. Ten changed lines, no format change, and existing notes keep working. The visible tag text changes (`To do` becomes `to-do`). Competes with #3.", "review_request": null, "maintainer_notes": "", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-19T14:45:48Z", "last_synced_at": "2026-10-19T14:56:55Z", "state_reason": null}
{"number": 8, "kind": "pr", "state": "open", "title": "Add `--json` output to `list`", "url": "https://github.com/someonesalter/quillpad/pull/8", "author": "someonesalter", "created_at": "2026-10-07T06:56:37Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-08T02:08:21Z", "labels": [], "comments_count": 1, "proposed_labels": ["enhancement", "ready"], "labels_reviewed": false, "action": "none", "reason": "Small, tested and additive: `list --json` leaves the default output alone.", "triaged_at": "2026-10-19T14:46:10Z", "triaged_by": "agent:Maya Ortiz", "batch_id": "seed", "agent_notes": "Read the full diff and the new test. The JSON path reuses the existing tag filter. One reviewer already ran it against real notes. No open questions.", "review_request": null, "maintainer_notes": "", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-19T14:45:48Z", "last_synced_at": "2026-10-19T14:56:55Z", "state_reason": null}
{"number": 9, "kind": "pr", "state": "open", "title": "Fix crash when the notes directory is missing", "url": "https://github.com/someonesalter/quillpad/pull/9", "author": "someonesalter", "created_at": "2026-10-07T06:56:40Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-19T14:55:23Z", "labels": [], "comments_count": 1, "proposed_labels": ["bug", "ready"], "labels_reviewed": false, "action": "none", "reason": "Fixes the first-run crash in #10 with a test.", "triaged_at": "2026-10-19T14:46:10Z", "triaged_by": "agent:Maya Ortiz", "batch_id": "seed", "agent_notes": "Read the full diff. `store.home()` creates the directory, and the new test covers a missing `QUILLPAD_HOME`. Confirmed in a clean container by a reviewer.", "review_request": null, "maintainer_notes": "", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-19T14:45:48Z", "last_synced_at": "2026-10-19T14:56:55Z", "state_reason": null}
{"number": 11, "kind": "pr", "state": "open", "title": "Rewrite storage on top of SQLite", "url": "https://github.com/someonesalter/quillpad/pull/11", "author": "someonesalter", "created_at": "2026-10-07T06:56:44Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-08T02:08:22Z", "labels": [], "comments_count": 2, "proposed_labels": ["enhancement"], "labels_reviewed": false, "action": "close", "reason": "Replaces the plain-file store that the README promises. Needs a maintainer decision on direction before more review.", "triaged_at": "2026-10-19T14:46:10Z", "triaged_by": "agent:Maya Ortiz", "batch_id": "seed", "agent_notes": "Read the full diff. `list` and `search` read only the database, so hand-edited Markdown is ignored. No migration and no benchmark against #18.", "review_request": null, "maintainer_notes": "", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-19T14:45:48Z", "last_synced_at": "2026-10-19T14:56:55Z", "state_reason": null}
